Comment: 1,0:01:47.52,0:01:49.38,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Open up your senses
Comment: 1,0:01:49.38,0:01:56.30,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Keep your guard up 'till you see the real world
Comment: 1,0:01:56.30,0:01:58.54,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Gotta take your chances
Comment: 1,0:01:58.54,0:02:02.56,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,You won't find your answers 'till you end the game
Comment: 1,0:02:02.56,0:02:05.52,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,With your own hands
Comment: 1,0:02:07.15,0:02:08.69,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's about time we wake up
Comment: 1,0:02:08.69,0:02:14.45,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Time we start to see the truth hidden beneath
Comment: 1,0:02:14.45,0:02:18.58,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Are you ready for the countdown
Comment: 1,0:02:18.60,0:02:21.20,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,You see the future's never certain
Comment: 1,0:02:21.24,0:02:27.08,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,But it's governed by the choices that we make
Comment: 1,0:02:27.79,0:02:30.70,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,You're standing on a fragile future
Comment: 1,0:02:30.70,0:02:38.18,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,And the truth will take your breath away
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Screen,,0,0,0,,=== END ===
