Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.80,0:43:26.63,EDCN,,0,0,0,,遠古神明從異界創造的奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.30,0:43:31.31,EDCN,,0,0,0,,文明曙光初現時的宇宙震顫
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.52,0:43:34.05,EDCN,,0,0,0,,我們曾熟識每個晨露滴落的瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.05,0:43:36.35,EDCN,,0,0,0,,站在萬物新生的至高點
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.35,0:43:38.61,EDCN,,0,0,0,,學會製造工具的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.61,0:43:40.81,EDCN,,0,0,0,,在即興規則中尋找出路
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.81,0:43:43.32,EDCN,,0,0,0,,我們寫下從天而降的法則
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.32,0:43:45.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,,唯一要戰勝的 是對惡魔的恐懼
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.65,0:43:47.86,EDCN,,0,0,0,,可怕的是我們正與時間賽跑
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.86,0:43:50.07,EDCN,,0,0,0,,當夕陽西沉 對你的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.07,0:43:52.79,EDCN,,0,0,0,,驅使我探索這顆星球的每個角落
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.79,0:43:55.08,EDCN,,0,0,0,,我們的旅程將自然發生
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.29,0:43:57.13,EDCN,,0,0,0,,讓渴望繼續燃燒
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.13,0:43:59.79,EDCN,,0,0,0,,直到尋得所求 不留遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.79,0:44:03.63,EDCN,,0,0,0,,遠古神明從異界創造的奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.42,0:44:08.27,EDCN,,0,0,0,,文明曙光初現時的宇宙震顫
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.84,0:44:09.72,EDCN,,0,0,0,,醒來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.94,0:44:10.93,EDCN,,0,0,0,,醒來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.93,0:44:12.89,EDCN,,0,0,0,,迎接文明破曉的曙光
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.57,0:44:14.22,EDCN,,0,0,0,,醒來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.73,0:44:15.52,EDCN,,0,0,0,,醒來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.52,0:44:17.73,EDCN,,0,0,0,,迎接文明破曉的曙光
Comment: 0,0:00:35.28,0:00:35.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:22.80,0:43:26.63,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Ancient creations by the Gods from another dimension
Dialogue: 1,0:43:27.30,0:43:31.31,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Cosmic sensation since the dawn of a civilization
Dialogue: 1,0:43:31.52,0:43:34.05,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Every moment we knew each morning dew
Dialogue: 1,0:43:34.05,0:43:36.35,EDEN,,0,0,0,,We were at the most prominent point all new
Dialogue: 1,0:43:36.35,0:43:38.61,EDEN,,0,0,0,,We learned how to make tools to make tools
Dialogue: 1,0:43:38.61,0:43:40.81,EDEN,,0,0,0,,And make do with the play-calling audible
Dialogue: 1,0:43:40.81,0:43:43.32,EDEN,,0,0,0,,We wrote all the rules that came down from the heavens
Dialogue: 1,0:43:43.32,0:43:45.65,EDEN,,0,0,0,,All we had to lose was the fear of the devils
Dialogue: 1,0:43:45.65,0:43:47.86,EDEN,,0,0,0,,And it's horrible we're running out of time
Dialogue: 1,0:43:47.86,0:43:50.07,EDEN,,0,0,0,,When the sun is setting and the thought of you
Dialogue: 1,0:43:50.07,0:43:52.79,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Got me gunning for more to explore this planet
Dialogue: 1,0:43:52.79,0:43:55.08,EDEN,,0,0,0,,We can go on tour and it happens organic
Dialogue: 1,0:43:55.29,0:43:57.13,EDEN,,0,0,0,,So let the desires burn
Dialogue: 1,0:43:57.13,0:43:59.79,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Till we find what we came for no stone unturned
Dialogue: 1,0:43:59.79,0:44:03.63,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Ancient creations by the Gods from another dimension
Dialogue: 1,0:44:04.42,0:44:08.27,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Cosmic sensation since the dawn of a civilization
Dialogue: 1,0:44:08.27,0:44:08.84,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Yo
Dialogue: 1,0:44:08.84,0:44:09.72,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Wake up
Dialogue: 1,0:44:09.94,0:44:10.93,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Wake up
Dialogue: 1,0:44:10.93,0:44:12.89,EDEN,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a civilization
Dialogue: 1,0:44:13.57,0:44:14.22,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Wake up
Dialogue: 1,0:44:14.73,0:44:15.52,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Wake up
Dialogue: 1,0:44:15.52,0:44:17.73,EDEN,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a civilization
